IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `ppl-leave`

-- Paid Parental Leave Act 2010 (Cth), ss 11D, 13, 21, 31AA-37, 41, 45, 31A, 60, 65, 71A, 72-74, 84, 101, 115C -- worked cases.
--
-- Every assertion is a claim about the ENCODING on stated facts, not about the law. Nothing here has been checked
-- against a decided case or subsidiary legislation (none was retrieved).
--
-- Fixtures are generated from a table of which flags are set (scratchpad gen_paid-parental-leave-act-2010.py). Expected results were written by
-- hand from the text.

-- Scenario facts: Oliver born 5 September 2030 (Chloe c061, Liam c063); Ruby born 22 January 2033 to Tahlia and Jake, unmarried,
-- Jake a sole trader (k052, k053); Ella born 12 April 2033, Chloe joins Jarrah on 1 February 2034 (c071, d04c). Income limits,
-- the hourly national minimum wage and the SG charge percentage below are HYPOTHETICAL inputs, not figures from the Act.

